      <p>Sweet sixteens have their own variation in format — some follow a formal, quinceañera-adjacent structure with a court and a choreographed dance, while others are built around a more casual party with close friends and a DJ. Either way, the honoree's grand entrance is usually the one non-negotiable moment of the night, and that is the moment we plan the whole pickup schedule around.</p>
