      <p>Quinceañeras and sweet sixteens, like any family celebration with dozens of moving pieces, rarely go exactly to the minute-by-minute plan. A photographer runs behind, a hairstylist needs ten more minutes, a family member is running late to the church. Hourly, as-directed booking is specifically built to absorb this kind of normal slippage — your chauffeur and vehicle are held for the full block of time you book, not released the moment a single scheduled pickup happens, so a delay in one part of the day does not create a scramble to re-book transportation for the rest of it.</p>
