      <p>For families without a dedicated planner managing these details, we are happy to take on a more active coordinating role ourselves — confirming photo locations, checking in with the venue ahead of time about loading and unloading procedures, and generally filling the logistics-coordination gap that a planner would otherwise handle. Let us know at booking if this is the kind of support your family needs, since it changes how we prepare for the day.</p>

