      <p>If the shower is a joint celebration — a couple's shower with both partners present, or a baby shower that doubles as a gender-reveal event — let us know the full group riding together so we can plan a vehicle that comfortably fits everyone being celebrated plus any immediate family joining them for the ride, rather than assuming a single guest of honor traveling alone.</p>

