      <p>For milestone events with a significant number of out-of-town guests, a welcome packet including transportation details — how to request pickup, the shuttle schedule if one is running, a direct phone number — helps guests who may be unfamiliar with current DC traffic patterns or parking rules navigate the event without added stress.</p>
