      <p>Finally, properties considering multiple ground transportation vendors for different needs (a budget shuttle option alongside a premium chauffeured option, for instance) should discuss this directly with our group accounts team — we can often structure a tiered offering within a single contract that gives the hotel's sales team more than one price point to offer different client segments.</p>

