      <p>Boutique and independent hotels, which often cannot match a large chain's internal shuttle fleet, find a shuttle contract with us particularly valuable as a way to compete credibly for group and conference business against larger branded competitors that advertise their own in-house airport shuttle as a standard amenity. A well-structured contract lets an independent property offer the same guest-facing promise without the capital cost of operating a dedicated fleet themselves.</p>

