      <p>Multiple births — twins or more — change the car seat math meaningfully, since two or more infant seats take up considerably more space than one. We recommend an SUV rather than a sedan by default for multiples, both for the seat space itself and so a parent has room to sit comfortably between them during the ride.</p>

