      <p>Finally, breed-specific concerns sometimes come up for larger or historically misunderstood breeds. We do not restrict bookings based on breed; our focus is simply on confirming the animal is properly secured and that the owner has it under control, the same standard we apply to any pet regardless of breed or size.</p>

