      <p>Whatever the occasion — an airport run, a vet visit, a cross-town move, or simply a trip where you'd rather not gamble on whether a rideshare driver accepts animals that day — confirming pet-friendly service in advance is a small step that removes a real source of uncertainty from pet travel in the DC area.</p>

