      <p>Some families start with a single trial booking before committing to a full recurring arrangement, simply to see how their parent responds to the chauffeur and vehicle before setting up a standing weekly or biweekly schedule. This is a completely reasonable way to ease into the arrangement, and we're glad to treat a first booking as exactly that — a trial run, not a binding commitment.</p>

