      <p>Facilities themselves — a dialysis center, a physical therapy practice, an assisted living community — sometimes maintain a list of transportation providers they are comfortable recommending to patients and families, based on a track record of reliability with punctuality that matters clinically. We are glad to provide references or documentation for a facility's own vetting process if that helps a family's broader care-coordination effort.</p>

